keywords:
  - photon-counting detector CT
  - virtual monoenergetic imaging
  - task-based image quality
  - denoising
  - iodine quantitation
  - simulation
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  Synthetic spectral simulation testbed (polyenergetic forward model,
  two-bin photon-counting detection, FBP reconstruction, water/iodine basis
  decomposition, virtual monoenergetic image synthesis) for studying how AI
  denoising shifts detectability-optimal energy and affects iodine
  quantitation in PCD-CT VMI stacks.
